<body style="height: auto; min-height: auto;">Ref No: {{{Case.Case_Number__c}}}<br />
<br />
Hi {{{Case.First_Name__c}}},&nbsp;<br />
<br />
Thank you for contacting us about your disrupted journey from {{{Case.Departure_City__c}}} on {{{Case.Email_Departure_Date_Time__c}}}.<br />
<br />
<strong>Things don’t always go to plan</strong><br />
<br />
We’re committed to getting you to your destination on time, however, bad weather, natural disasters, technical problems and other issues can cause flight delays and cancellations, and your safety is our first priority.<br />
<br />
Our priority is to minimise disruptions and rebook any onward connections on your ticket when a flight is delayed, so I'm sorry to hear about the error made by our team, causing further stress/delays for you.<br />
<br />
<em><strong>-If a Frequent Flyer:-</strong></em><br />
<br />
As a gesture of goodwill, I’ve credited {{{Case.Recovery_Quantity__c}}} Qantas Points to your Frequent Flyer account.<br />
<br />
You can use the points towards flights, the purchase of food and wine through Qantas Wine or a range of products from Qantas Marketplace.<br />
<br />
<em><strong>-If not a Frequent Flyer: -</strong></em><br />
<br />
As a gesture of goodwill, I’d like to arrange a credit of {{{Case.Recovery_Quantity__c}}} Qantas Points to your Frequent Flyer account.<br />
<br />
You can use the points towards flights, the purchase of food and wine through Qantas Wine or a range of products from Qantas Marketplace.<br />
<br />
Please advise us of your Frequent Flyer number by replying to this email so we can credit points to your account.<br />
<br />
If you’re not already a member, you can join free of charge via our website <a href="https://www.qantas.com/au/en/frequent-flyer/discover-and-join/join-now.html/code/FAMILYFREE">using the following link.</a><br />
<br />
<strong>We’re here to help</strong><br />
<br />
I was sorry to hear that the delay meant you missed your &lt;meeting/dinner/concert/planned accommodation/train&gt;.<br />
<br />
While we can’t provide compensation on this occasion, if you had any unexpected expenses because of the &lt;delay/cancellation&gt;, your travel insurance policy may cover these sorts of situations.<br />
<br />
Please let us know if you’d like us to provide you with an insurance letter to assist with any claim.<br />
<br />
<strong>We value your opinion</strong><br />
<br />
Customer feedback plays an important role in our continuous improvement process so that we can provide you with exceptional service from start to finish.<br />
<br />
I want to assure you that I've passed your comments on to the relevant team for review.<br />
<br />
Thank you for taking the time to let us know about your experience and we look forward to welcoming you onboard again soon.<br />
&nbsp;</body>
</html>